OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss criticised for
OL,4,A127-date theatre tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA newly elected #79,000-a-year police
OL,7,Fcommissioner is facing criticism for
OL,8,Fannouncing a 127-date national theatre
OL,9,Ftour.
OL,11,FOpposition parties have questioned how
OL,12,FReform UK's Colin Sutton will be able
OL,13,Fto focus on his job overseeing Norfolk
OL,14,FPolice, which he was elected to in
OL,15,FJuly.
OL,17,FThe former detective is due to present
OL,18,Fhis true-crime show in theatres across
OL,19,Fthe UK next year discussing police
OL,20,Finvestigations, with tickets priced at
OL,21,Faround #40.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
