OL,3,GNEWSAPolice boss criticised for
OL,4,A127-date theatre tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokeswoman for his office said the
OL,7,Ftour "would not impact upon his ability
OL,8,Fto discharge his duties", but Labour MP
OL,9,FBen Goldsborough warned "you can't
OL,10,Fpolice a county from the back of a tour
OL,11,Fbus".
